.TH MACONF 1 "September 2026" "maconf 1.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
maconf \- get and set common macOS preferences
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B maconf
.RI [ \-hv ] " command " [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B maconf
reads and writes selected macOS preferences using
.BR defaults (1)
and restarts affected processes when required.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B dock addspacer [narrow|wide]
Add a narrow or wide spacer to the Dock. The default is wide.
.TP
.B dock delay [seconds|none|normal|reset|short]
Read or set the Dock auto-hide reveal delay.
.TP
.B dock hiddenapps [conceal|reveal]
Read or set whether hidden Dock applications are opaque or translucent.
.TP
.B dock position [bottom|left|right]
Read or set the Dock position.
.TP
.B dock restart
Restart the Dock.
.TP
.B finder fullpath [hide|show]
Read or set whether Finder's title bar shows the full POSIX path.
.TP
.B finder restart
Restart Finder.
.TP
.B screencapture format [jpg|png]
Read or set the screen-capture file format.
.TP
.B screencapture location [path]
Read or set the directory where screen captures are saved.
.TP
.B screencapture shadow [true|false]
Read or set whether screen captures include a window shadow. The aliases
.BR yes / on
and
.BR no / off
are also accepted.
.TP
.B users hide username
Hide a user from the macOS login window.
.TP
.B users show username
Show a user on the macOS login window.
.TP
.B help [command [setting]]
Show command-specific help.
.TP
.B version
Print the maconf version.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h
Show help.
.TP
.B \-v
Print the version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 16
Invalid option or argument.
.TP
.B 17
The macOS
.B defaults
utility is unavailable.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
maconf dock position left
maconf dock delay short
maconf finder fullpath show
maconf screencapture location "$HOME/Desktop"
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR defaults (1),
.BR dscl (1)
